<title>USA: NAC RE Corp CEO remains, Brown named COO.</title>
<headline>NAC RE Corp CEO remains, Brown named COO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAC Re Corp said on Thursday that Ronald Bornhuetter will remain chairman and chief executive through June 2000 after agreeing to a three-year extension of his contract.</p>
<p>Nicholas Brown Jr has been named president and chief operating officer of NAC Re Corp and also president and chief executive of the company's subsidiary, NAC Reinsurance Corp, the company said.</p>
</text>
